   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <opener>
                        <dateline>
                            <date when="1933-09-29">September the 29-th.1933</date>
                        </dateline>
                        <salute>Dear Mr Budgen,</salute>
                    </opener>
                    <p>                    	just a line to tell you that the Odyssey Press should be written to c/o The <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">Albatross Press</seg>, 37 rue Boulard Paris (XIII°)</p>        	                                            	<p>Good luck</p>
                    <closer>                                                                    	<salute>sincerely yours</salute>                                                                    	<signed>Paul Léon</signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">In a <rs type="letter" key="L_71468">letter to Budgen of 3 September 1933</rs> (<name type="work">LIII</name> 283) JJ had suggested to Budgen that the continental rights for <name type="work">JJMU</name> could be managed by the Albatross Press, of which the Odyssey Press (which had published <name type="work" key="W_ULYSSES">Ulysses</name> in 1932) was a subsidiary.</note>
            </div>
      </body>
   </text>
